@LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5275
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Criar usuário
POST {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@limas.com",
  "password": "senha123",
  "name": "Admin"
}

### Listar usuários
GET {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users

### Buscar por id
GET {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{id}

### Atualizar usuário
PUT {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Novo Nome"
}

### Remover usuário
DELETE {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{id}

### Login
POST {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@limas.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Usuário logado
GET {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (revoga o token)
POST {{LimasHotel.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
